MFLOW 2
NAME Heat exchanger & humidity
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 The blower pushes wet sand through the shell\nof HX01; hot water at 160 C runs through its\ntubes. TT1 reads the shell outlet, TIC1 sets\nthe hot flow (drive U1) to hold 80 C. MT1 and\nMT2 measure the air and the sand's moisture.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Set TIC1 to 120 C (faceplate): the water\nboils off and MT1 rises. Turn the blower\ndown (wheel): less flow, hotter outlet.\nAdd more water to the feeder: MT2 goes up.

