LABEL 250.00 250.00 HEAT EXCHANGER & HUMIDITY\nWet sand is blown through the shell of HX01.\nTIC1 (PID) sets its hot flow through U1 to\nhold the outlet at 80 C (TT1).\nMT1: the air by the stream (% RH).\nMT2: the moisture of the sand in the bucket.
